{"repositoryId":892830182,"availability":"available","full":"NatLabRockies/COMPASS","name":"COMPASS","description":"INFRA-COMPASS is a tool that leverages Large Language Models (LLMs) to create and maintain an inventory of state and local codes and ordinances applicable to energy infrastructure.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":17,"forks":4,"created":"2024-11-22T21:31:04Z","updated":"2026-10-13T03:54:18Z","license":"BSD-3-Clause","branch":"main","homepage":"https://natlabrockies.github.io/COMPASS/","topics":["ai","automation","energy-analysis","energy-policy","infrastructure","llm","ordinances","permitting","siting"],"demo":"https://natlabrockies.github.io/COMPASS/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:41.231Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:41.231Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:41.231Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-13T07:37:41.231Z","stars":17,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["COMPASS (formally the Infrastructure Continuous Ordinance Mapping for Planning and Siting Systems, or \"INFRA-COMPASS\") is an innovative software tool that harnesses the power of Large Language Models (LLMs) to automate the compilation and continued maintenance of an inventory of state and local codes and ordinances pertaining to energy infrastructure.","At a high level, COMPASS does two things: it retrieves the right ordinance documents for each jurisdiction you ask about, and then extracts structured data from those documents into a versioned database that downstream users can query as a CSV, Excel workbook, or GeoPackage.","What makes COMPASS different from simply asking ChatGPT for ordinance data is the architecture around the LLM call:"],"features":["Structured, downstream-ready output — consistent CSV rows with stable column","Hallucination guardrails — cleaned text is checked against the source and dropped","Source-URL traceability — every record carries a URL back to the original","Cost control — cheap heuristic filters reject obviously irrelevant text before"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NatLabRockies/COMPASS/blob/main/README.rst","fingerprint":"3843fb88d25866e3a841ea4bc80af43651f327bd1be0e723c0effc84749fc8ad","extractedAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:41.661Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:41.661Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"COMPASS (formally the Infrastructure Continuous Ordinance Mapping for Planning and Siting Systems, or \"INFRA-COMPASS\") is an innovative software tool that harnesses the power of Large Language Models (LLMs) to automate the compilation and continued maintenance of an inventory of state and local codes and ordinances pertaining to energy infrastructure.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NatLabRockies/COMPASS/blob/main/README.rst"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Quickstart ========== To run a quick COMPASS demo, set up a personal OpenAI API key and run:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NatLabRockies/COMPASS/blob/main/README.rst"}],"fingerprint":"3843fb88d25866e3a841ea4bc80af43651f327bd1be0e723c0effc84749fc8ad","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NatLabRockies/COMPASS/blob/main/README.rst","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:41.661Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-13T03:54:18Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NatLabRockies/COMPASS/blob/main/README.rst","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:41.662Z","hash":"3843fb88d25866e3a841ea4bc80af43651f327bd1be0e723c0effc84749fc8ad","originalBytes":4943,"storedBytes":4943,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["image","compass","target","ordinance","alt","csv","data","development","documents","license","pipeline","pixi","pypi","pythonv","ruff","run","see","siting","structured","swr","two","what","zenodo","about","align","architecture","around","ask","asking","automate","badge","basics","call","capacity-modeling","center","chatgpt","code","codes","column","compilation","co